// The DeadlockError report carries the message of spec/04-semantics.md,
// Worker and Task Faults, on stderr. The main task waits in task.receive()
// and the one spawned task waits too, so no task can run again.
//
// Native also appends a stack trace and the tasks that wait, so the STDERR
// line pins the first line only (tools/check_spec_probes.py compares the
// expected stderr lines as a prefix).
fun waiter() {
    task.receive();
}

task.spawn(waiter);
task.receive();

// STATUS: error
// STDERR: Deadlock: every task waits in receive.
